flowchart LR
  accTitle: Authoring, planning, and runtime resolution stages
  accDescr: Independently authored Contracts, Anchors, bindings, and configuration declarations are pinned and resolved into a deterministic plan before lifecycle adapters create endpoints, materialize configuration, and collect runtime evidence.

  subgraph Authoring["Authoring time · reusable declarations"]
    direction TB
    Contract["Contract payload<br/>operation · protocol · schemas · security"]
    Anchor["Anchor<br/>UUID · role · Contract selector"]
    Binding["Anchor binding<br/>deployment service · named port"]
    Config["Service configuration<br/>declared materializer targets"]
    Contract --> Anchor
    Anchor --> Binding
    Binding -.->|same DeploymentService| Config
  end

  subgraph Planning["Planning time · deterministic resolution"]
    direction TB
    Inputs["Validate and pin inputs<br/>DOT and Contract IDs · versions"]
    Selectors["Resolve Contract selectors<br/>without copying Contract facts"]
    Compatibility["Evaluate compatibility<br/>COMPATIBLE · INCOMPATIBLE · UNKNOWN"]
    Connection["Resolve connection<br/>deployment · service · named port"]
    Handoff["Derive optional handoff<br/>operation URL · channel · host · port"]
    Target["Verify declared target<br/>type · service · sensitivity"]
    Plan["Emit deterministic plan<br/>readiness order · reasons · actions"]
    Inputs --> Selectors --> Compatibility --> Connection
    Connection --> Handoff --> Target --> Plan
  end

  subgraph Runtime["Runtime · deployment-instance facts"]
    direction TB
    Apply["Lifecycle adapters<br/>apply only with complete evidence"]
    Endpoint["Concrete endpoint<br/>allocated host · address · port"]
    Inject["Configuration handoff<br/>value or secret reference"]
    Workload["Running workloads<br/>platform-native state"]
    Probe["Active probes and policy evidence<br/>reachability · authentication · trust"]
    Apply --> Endpoint
    Endpoint -.->|only when required| Inject
    Endpoint --> Workload
    Inject --> Workload
    Workload -.-> Probe
  end

  Authoring -->|validated, immutable inputs| Planning
  Planning -->|apply after complete evidence| Runtime

  classDef authored fill:#e8f2f7,stroke:#2b6777,color:#17232d,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef process fill:#eef6f3,stroke:#39826f,color:#17232d,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef decision fill:#fff7d6,stroke:#b7791f,color:#3d2b0a,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef runtime fill:#f6f8fa,stroke:#687887,color:#17232d,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef evidence fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#2f7d45,color:#173c23,stroke-width:1.5px;
  class Contract,Anchor,Binding,Config authored;
  class Inputs,Selectors,Connection,Handoff,Target,Plan process;
  class Compatibility decision;
  class Apply,Endpoint,Inject,Workload runtime;
  class Probe evidence;
